\vspace{0.22cm}
{\Large\bfseries\color{ChapterAsh} 全書一句話 \textperiodcentered\ The Whole Book in One Frame}

\vspace{0.30cm}
\fcolorbox{ScriptureGold}{ScriptureBg}{%
\begin{minipage}{4.6in}
\centering\vspace{0.2cm}
\normalsize\color{CommentaryBrown}
\textbf{\color{DawnGold!80!black}敬畏耶和華}是知識的開端；愚妄人藐視智慧和訓誨。\\
\footnotesize\itshape The fear of the LORD is the beginning of knowledge — 1:7\\[0.6em]
\normalsize\upshape
惟\textbf{\color{DawnGold!80!black}敬畏耶和華}的婦女必得稱讚。\\
\footnotesize\itshape A woman who fears the LORD, she shall be praised — 31:30\\[0.4em]
\small\color{ChapterAsh} 箴言 1:7、31:30 \textperiodcentered\ Proverbs 1:7, 31:30
\vspace{0.2cm}
\end{minipage}}

\vspace{0.35cm}
{\small\color{TextGray} 三十一章 \textperiodcentered\ 五卷 \textperiodcentered\ 首尾同一句話\\
\textit{Thirty-one chapters \textperiodcentered\ five collections \textperiodcentered\ one phrase, first and last}}

\vspace{0.30cm}
{\small
\renewcommand{\arraystretch}{1.3}
\begin{tabular}{@{}p{2.8cm}p{2.4cm}p{6.9cm}@{}}
\toprule
\textbf{段落} & \textbf{章節} & \textbf{在全書的展開} \\
\midrule
智慧的呼喚 & 1-9章 & 父對子的長篇勸勉，智慧位格化為街市上呼喊的女子，自稱在創造之先已與神同在（8:22-31） \\
所羅門的箴言（一） & 10-22:16章 & 三百七十五對句，義人與惡人、智慧與愚昧的鮮明對比，鋪滿生活的每一面 \\
智慧人的言語 & 22:17-24:34章 & 「我兒」式的具體訓誨，另附智慧人的補充言語 \\
希西家人所輯所羅門箴言 & 25-29章 & 希西家的人所謄錄的第二批所羅門箴言，多用比擬手法 \\
亞古珥與利慕伊勒 & 30-31章 & 亞古珥的謙卑禱告，利慕伊勒王母的教訓，終於才德婦人一天的作息 \\
\bottomrule
\end{tabular}
}

\vspace{0.4cm}
\textcolor{ScriptureGold}{\rule{2.5in}{0.7pt}}
\vspace{0.3cm}

{\bfseries\color{ChapterAsh} 讀經之鑰 \textperiodcentered\ How to Read This Book}

\vspace{0.18cm}
\begin{minipage}{4.6in}
\small\color{TextGray}
不是來讀一本格言小語錄，是來看智慧如何從一個抽象的呼喚，一步步走成具體的、
一天二十四小時的生活。\\
全書開頭與結尾用同一句話扣住——「敬畏耶和華」；中間三十章要回答的只有一個
問題：這句話落在吃飯、說話、理財、教養兒女、治家上，是甚麼樣子？\\[0.5em]
\textit{\footnotesize
You are not reading a book of clever sayings — you are watching wisdom move,
step by step, from an abstract call into a concrete, hour-by-hour life.\\
The book opens and closes on the same phrase — "the fear of the LORD." The
thirty chapters in between answer one question: what does that phrase look
like at the dinner table, in speech, in money, in raising children, in
running a household?}
\end{minipage}

\vfill
{\scriptsize\color{LightGray} PubHub 三書精讀系統 \textperiodcentered\ Soli Deo Gloria}

\vspace{0.3in}
